 "metadata": {
  "identifier": "his_girl_friday",
  "title": "His Girl Friday",
  "mediatype": "movies",
  "description": "Hilarious romantic comedy starring Cary Grant and Rosalind Russell.  Russell is rough and tumble reporter looking to get out of the news racket by marrying and becoming a house wife after her divorce from newspaper publisher Grant.  Just when she is about to leave town with her husband-to-be the still lovesick Grant drafts her to cover one final breaking news sensation.   \n\nAlong with plenty of laughs and fast paced dialog this film provides a witty and cynical look at news business.\n\nThere is a slight audio sync problem in the first couple minutes of the film.  It is present on the source medium and is very brief.",
